{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"EPIC COMPLETE — closed with a CERTIFIED completion signature (plan-review: PASS, completion-verifier: PASS).\n\nAll 4 leaves landed via Gerrit (LLM-Review +1 & Verified +1) and closed certified:\n- 08ab forcible-diminished-lamb — optional Terraform structural grounding (leaf 1, commit 6dde7dffe6b2)\n- afe3 depraved-classless-rooster — ground code-review IaC findings (leaf 2)\n- 1c52 salmon-abominable-pupa — probe_source local+registry grounding (leaf 3, commit 10af5f28bcaf)\n- c6ce schematic-gleesome-ballpython — terraform-config-inspect corroborator (leaf 4, commit 57ec21df, Gerrit 2672 MERGED)\n\nCertification note: the epic's first close withheld its completion signature because leaf 08ab's completion closure had gone stale (materially edited since its original verdict; attestation predated component-level fingerprinting) and its plan-review was stale-code after siblings landed. Remediated by reopening 08ab, correcting its file_impact ADR references (0111 -> 0115, the terraform ADR's actual number), re-running plan-review (PASS), and re-closing it through the completion gate (certified). Re-reviewed and re-closed the epic -> now fully attested.\n\nResidual deferred backlog tracked in follow-up ticket ca1f-88ee-6211-4bff (uncheering-ammonic-dalmatian); none block this epic."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788608037230341001,"uuid":"d25da1ee-0d79-488c-9a0d-cbf8067cbca6"}